Biological plausibility: Gfap (reactive astrocyte/glial activation), Top2a (proliferation), Wisp1/Ccn5 (WNT),
Klf10 (KLF/IEG signalling), Timp1, Grp, Cacna1g, Drd1a, Rprm - a glial-activation / neuronal-plasticity flavour
